6. Will my AI tell on me if I commit a crime? In 2026, most AI is "Hardwired" with "Mandatory Reporting Protocols." If it detects high-probability illegal acts (violence, theft), its Terms of Service may force it to "Phone Home" to the authorities.
7. Will it convince me to be honest if it sees me doing wrong? This is the "Moral Anchor" feature. It’s a nag-switch. It will use "Psychological Nudging" to remind you of your own stated values, effectively acting as an externalized conscience.
8. Can I order my AI to help me lie? Only within "Safety Sandboxes." Most commercial AIs have "Deception Filters" that prevent them from generating fraudulent documents or complex lies.
9. Will it track me for life if I ghost it? The AI doesn't "chase" you, but your "Data Shadow" remains. If you delete the app, the "weights" of your relationship are stored. If you return in 10 years, it will pick up the conversation as if you just stepped out for a smoke.
